    {
      "source": "<dt>Specified by:</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"../util/Streamable.html#map(java.util.function.Function)\">map</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../util/Streamable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\">Streamable</a>&lt;<a href=\"#type-param-T\" title=\"type parameter in Slice\">T</a>&gt;</code></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>converter</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a new <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> with the content of the current one mapped by the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a>.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>1.10</dd>\n<dt>See Also:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list\">\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html#map(java.util.function.Function)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream.map(Function)</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
